00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.830 align:start position:0%
 
all is quiet at the facility where  scp-1027 floats in its containment  chamber the scp does not seem to react  as a guard opens the door to its room  the agent gropes for the light switch he  is new to the scp foundation and this is  his first night working on his own harsh  fluorescent light fills the room the  guard lets out a yelp when he sees  scp-1027 for the first time unable to  control his curiosity the guard  approaches the containment chamber  scp-1027 looks like a human nervous  system that has been extracted from its  body the brain eyes and connected nerves  are all exposed as if some mad doctor  perfectly dissected a human scp-10  does not move gross the guard thinks as  he taps on the glass casing with his  rifle he jumps back slightly in surprise  it seemed as if the eyeball had twitched  slightly to look at him so creepy the  guard says out loud he turns around to  exit the room as he approaches the door  the lights flicker he begins to walk a  little quicker suddenly the lights go  out completely plunging the room into  darkness a moment later the hum of the  fluorescence resumes as the lights come  back to life the guard slowly pivots to  look at the containment chamber  scp-1027 still floats motionless in its  sailing solution the guard sighs and  chuckles to himself for getting spooked  he turns and walks out of the room  closing the door behind him he makes it  a few steps down the hallway before  stopping the guard smacks his forehead  with the palm of his hand i forgot to  turn off the damn light he says he heads  back to the room  scp-1027 is contained in he reaches his  hand out to grab the doorknob it is warm  to the touch the guard turns it and  pushes the door open a scream gets  caught in his throat and only a slight  wheeze escapes his lungs standing in  front of him is scp-1027  the nervous system seems to pulsate as  it reaches its arms out towards the  guard who is paralyzed with fear the  guard feels a slight twinge in his ear  as a series of nerves enter his auditory  canal then he hears a voice inside of  his head it's his own voice and it's  telling him to escape his body the next  morning scp agents and scientists  returned to the site for another day's  work one scientist is surprised to find  the door to  scp-1027's room wide open he steps in  and looks around  scp-1027 floats motionless inside of its  saline containment chamber the scientist  shrugs turns off the light and closes  the door later that day a feeding team  enters  scp-1027's room pushing a cart with a  brain of a cow on top of it the three  members of the group are wearing level  four bioprotective equipment they enter  the room and secure the door behind them  one of the men walks over to the  containment chamber and pushes a few  buttons as the liquid in the tube slowly  begins to drain  scp-1027 drops down into a laying  position on the examination table below  it when the water is completely gone the  glass tube hisses open a moment later  scp-1027 sits up it looks about the room  with its exposed eyeballs its nerves  wriggle like tiny worms as they sense  the world around them  scp-1027 rotates its body so it's  sitting with its legs over the side of  the table the feeding team tries to  remain calm but seeing a nervous system  move without an actual body is a bit  disconcerting to say the least  researchers found that  scp-1027 was able to survive without the  protective casing of muscles and skin  because each nerve cell is surrounded by  myelin sheathing 300 times thicker than  that of normal human cells the scp  slowly slides off the table and proceeds  towards the cow brain that has been  placed in the middle of the room the  feeding team backs as far away from the  scp as possible until their bodies are  pressed up against the wall scp  researchers told them that the  containment suits would protect them  from 1027 but these same researchers  have been wrong before  scp-1027 stands next to the cow brain  and looks down at it normally at this  point  scp-1027 would extend its nerves and  wrap them around the bovine brain there  would be a slight pulsing and the brain  would begin to denature it is still  unclear if scp-1027 consumes the actual  brain matter or just feeds on the  residual chemical energy that resides in  the tissue the feeding team carries out  this procedure once a week which seems  to keep  scp-1027 happy but this time scp-1020  just stares at the brain as if it is  contemplating whether it is worth eating  it is almost as if  scp-1027 isn't hungry as if it is  already eaten but the team knows that's  crazy as they are the only ones who feed  this scp and it has been exactly a week  since its previous meal the feeding team  turned their heads to look at one  another through the clear face shields  in their suits one of the men shrugs as  they all turned back to watch what  scp-1027 does next the scp lifts its  head so that its eyes are looking  straight at the feeding team one of the  members reaches behind him searching for  the doorknob then  scp-1027 slowly turns around and walks  back towards the table it lays down and  goes still someone needs to lock it back  in its containment chamber one of the  men says that's jerry's job responds  another as he pushes the man next to him  towards where scp-1020 is laying alright  fine i'll do it but if that thing eats  me and turns me into an scp you two will  be the first people i go after jerry  walks slowly towards the containment  chamber he stretches his arm as far as  it will go to keep as much distance as  possible between his body and  scp-1027 jerry pushes a big red button  and the glass tube hisses close the  containment chamber fills with saline  water and  scp-1027 is once again suspended in the  liquid-filled tube the research team  grabs the cart with a cow brain on it  and rushes out of the room slamming the  door behind them they informed the head  of the facility of the odd behavior as  cp 1027 had exhibited but he is a busy  man and shrugs it off as just an anomaly  i don't eat when it's hungry enough give  it a week and then try again the  facility commander tells the men the  feeding team walks silently down the  hall to the decontamination room where  they will take off their suits and  shower as a precaution to prevent the  spread of any foreign agents the  peculiar behavior of  scp-1027 lingers in their minds they  enter the room and begin to joke with  one another to ease their nerves this  makes them feel better it is silly to  worry about scp-1027 now that it is  safely contained in its chamber once  again they turn the shower heads on and  steam slowly fills the room i might call  out sick next week just to be safe that  scp is going to be really hungry after  missing its meal this week and i don't  want to become a snack one of the men  says as he scrubs his body yeah that's  not a bad idea responds jury who knows  what the creepy thing will do if it ever  gets out of its containment chamber  maybe it'll eat our brains although  there wouldn't be much seed in your case  bob  he says pointing to his teammate the  whole team laughs as the room continues  to fill with steam jerry's smile slowly  fades as he feels something tickle his  ear he uses his hand to brush whatever  it was away but the sensation comes back  jerry washes the soap from his face and  turns around all he can see is steam hey  you guys stop messing around jerry yells  what are you talking about jerry one of  the other members of the team asks jerry  sees the steam move directly in front of  him he rubs his eyes to help him focus  through the moisture when he takes his  hands away an instance of  scp-1027 is standing directly in front  of him he is staring straight into the  eyeballs of the nervous system of the  guard who had entered  scp-1027's room the previous night what  the but before jerry can finish his  sentence the instance of scp-1027 shoves  its nerves down jerry's throat silencing  his voice it then sticks the nerves of  its hand into jerry's ear the scp-1027  instance feels around in jerry's head  until it locates the part of the brain  it is looking for and connects to it  jerry's brain is flooded with dopamine  and chemical signals are transferred  from the scp-1027 instance directly into  its victim's brain jerry's nervous  system now wants to break free of the  flesh casing that contains it jerry you  okay over there asks bob you've gone  yeah kind of quiet but there is no  response jerry's nervous system moves  his body towards one of the shower knobs  and turns the hot water on full blast  it's hoping that if the water is hot  enough it will scald the skin and muscle  tissue making it easier to remove from  the body  jerry the other team member says  suddenly the steam shifts and the  scp-1027 instance is standing in the  middle of the shower room the remaining  members of the feeding team scream in  horror they try to escape but slip on  the wet shower floor  scp-1027 slowly approaches them with its  nerves outstretched the echoing shouts  from the feeding team are muffled as a  series of nerves enter their bodies the  day continues at the scp site as if  everything was normal agents are  debriefed on previous missions  scientists experiment on different scps  and administrators meet to plan the next  acquisition the sun begins to set and  people start to leave for the day all is  quiet that night as a new security guard  makes his rounds the guard that the  administrator of the facility had just  hired disappeared without a trace the  night before his disappearance was  chalked up to nerves and being too  scared to return to work the new guard  checks each room to make sure everything  is secure he approaches the room that  contains scp-1027  he opens the door flicks on the light  and looks at the scp floating in its  containment tube gross the guard says  out loud he flicks off the light and  continues his rounds near the far part  of the hallway the door to the  decontamination room is slightly ajar  the guard approaches and pushes it open  with his night stick he takes one step  into the darkness and feels the wall for  the light switch he turns the lights on  there is nothing but a wet floor the  guard shrugs and turns off the lights he  walks through the doorway  as he steps back into the hallway he is  greeted by four instances of scp-1027  the guard opens his mouth to scream as  the nervous systems reach out their  tendrils and plunge them into his ears  nose and mouth now watch  scp-1548 the star the hateful scp  animation or check out scp-001 the  children or boro cycle scp animation

